 524+ A019              ;Bit 7 of A indicates type: 0 = numeric, 1 = string.
 525+ A019              ;
 526+ A019              ;
 527+ A019              ;POS - horizontal cursor position.
 528+ A019              ;VPOS - vertical cursor position.
 529+ A019              ;EOF - return status of file.
 530+ A019              ;BGET - read byte from file.
 531+ A019              ;INKEY - as GET but wait only n centiseconds.
 532+ A019              ;GET - wait for keypress and return ASCII value.
 533+ A019              ;GET(n) - input from Z80 port n.
 534+ A019              ;ASC - ASCII value of string.
 535+ A019              ;LEN - length of string.
 536+ A019              ;LOMEM - location of dynamic variables.
 537+ A019              ;HIMEM - top of available RAM.
 538+ A019              ;PAGE - start of current text page.
 539+ A019              ;TOP - address of first free byte after program.
 540+ A019              ;ERL - line number where last error occurred.
 541+ A019              ;ERR - number of last error.
 542+ A019              ;COUNT - number of printing characters since CR.
 543+ A019              ;Results are integer numeric.
 544+ A019              ;
